          "y": 36,
          "name": "Masthead Chinese",
          "fill": "$hl-ink",
          "content": "登記冊之分流",
          "fontFamily": "$hl-display",
          "fontSize": 17,
          "fontWeight": "500"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "RaU6j",
          "x": 920,
          "y": 152,
          "name": "Deck Chinese",
          "fill": "$hl-ink2",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": 560,
          "content": "這個登記冊上的每一間社團，最終都歸入十七個用途之一。其中「宗教」再分為十一個信仰傳統。色帶的寬度就是社團的數目——沒有比例的重複計算，也沒有估算。",
          "lineHeight": 1.7,
          "fontFamily": "$hl-body",
          "fontSize": 11.5,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "cFjcb",
          "x": 56,
          "y": 1092,
          "name": "Footer Caveat ZH",
          "fill": "$hl-ink2",
          "content": "信仰與社群分類由機構名稱推斷，只宜視為線索，不可作定論。",
          "fontFamily": "$hl-mono",
          "fontSize": 8,
          "fontWeight": "normal",
          "letterSpacing": 0.06
